{"_id":"9k2SyrPJ9Nuc3rfl","img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/the-slithering-bestiary/cursebreaker.webp","items":[{"_id":"ikfBxpjmTlocaUVu","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","name":"Arcane Innate Spells","sort":100000,"system":{"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"description":{"value":""},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"proficiency":{"value":1},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"slots":{},"slug":null,"spelldc":{"dc":0,"value":0},"tradition":{"value":"arcane"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spellcastingEntry","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!9k2SyrPJ9Nuc3rfl.ikfBxpjmTlocaUVu"},{"_id":"OzGRy5Q3gxjky0Q9","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.OyFCwQuw8XRazsNr"},"img":"icons/magic/control/buff-flight-wings-runes-blue-white.webp","name":"Remove Curse (At Will) (See Undo Curse)","sort":200000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":true,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Your touch grants a reprieve to a cursed creature. You attempt to counteract one curse afflicting the target. If the curse comes from a cursed item or other external source, a success indicates that the target creature can rid itself of the cursed item, but it doesn't remove the curse from the item.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":4},"location":{"heightenedLevel":10,"value":"ikfBxpjmTlocaUVu"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"remove-curse","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"],"value":["concentrate","healing","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!9k2SyrPJ9Nuc3rfl.OzGRy5Q3gxjky0Q9"},{"_id":"PqRogFZRMSDSuBh2","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Fist","sort":300000,"system":{"attack":{"value":""},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"bonus":{"value":21},"damageRolls":{"0":{"damage":"2d10+10","damageType":"bludgeoning"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["magical","reach-10","unarmed"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!9k2SyrPJ9Nuc3rfl.PqRogFZRMSDSuBh2"},{"_id":"BIFXG8tlrggVbQZ0","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.r34QDwKiWZoVymJa"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Golem Antimagic","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>Harmed by cold and water (@Damage[5d8[untyped]], @Damage[2d6[untyped]] from areas or persistent damage); healed by acid (area @Damage[2d6[healing]] HP); slowed by earth</p><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.GolemAntimagic]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[],"slug":"golem-golem-antimagic","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!9k2SyrPJ9Nuc3rfl.BIFXG8tlrggVbQZ0"},{"_id":"qxmme69IDeE8LxLa","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Vulnerable to Stone to Flesh","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>A @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Pr1ruNTbzGn3H9w5]{Stone to Flesh} spell negates Cursebreaker's golem antimagic and its resistance to physical damage for 1 round.</p>\n<p>A @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.znv4ECL7ZtuiagtA]{Petrify} spell reverses this effect immediately.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"vulnerable-to-stone-to-flesh","toggleable":true},{"exceptions":["adamantine"],"key":"Resistance","predicate":[{"not":"vulnerable-to-stone-to-flesh"}],"type":"physical","value":10}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!9k2SyrPJ9Nuc3rfl.qxmme69IDeE8LxLa"},{"_id":"vxR33jABpWbixKMb","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Impose Paralysis","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Cursebreaker hits a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed} creature</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The creature must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:27|options:inflicts:paralyzed] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 round.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["incapacitation"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!9k2SyrPJ9Nuc3rfl.vxR33jABpWbixKMb"},{"_id":"xoigCRlVfwponLe7","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.qt2exWwQTzoObKfW"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Inexorable March","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Check[fortitude|dc:32|traits:damaging-effect]</p>\n<p>On a critical success, the resisting creature takes no damage; otherwise it is damaged as if hit by Cursebreaker's fist.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The golem Strides up to its Speed, pushing back each creature whose space it moves into and damaging them if they try to stop its movement. A creature can attempt to bar the way by succeeding at a Fortitude save.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[],"slug":"golem-inexorable-march","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!9k2SyrPJ9Nuc3rfl.xoigCRlVfwponLe7"},{"_id":"6yEfEcRS7ayfG7nE","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Slowing Pulse","sort":800000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Each creature in a @Template[emanation|distance:10] must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:27|traits:incapacitation|options:inflicts:slowed] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>Cursebreaker can't use Slowing Pulse again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Slowing Pulse]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["arcane","concentrate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!9k2SyrPJ9Nuc3rfl.6yEfEcRS7ayfG7nE"},{"_id":"rl2d3yDbUo9Wxxil","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Undo Curse","sort":900000,"system":{"act